# ShellCheck — Codacy toggle. No directives, which for ShellCheck means every
# check runs: its defaults ARE the baseline. eslint, stylelint, remark and
# biome are the opposite — empty means no rules there.
#
# Reach here is near zero: this vault's shell lives in workflow `run:` blocks,
# and ShellCheck does not parse YAML.
#
# Exempt at the offending line (`# shellcheck disable=SCxxxx  # reason`), not
# repo-wide.
